Most of the Python files in this repository are copied or adapted, largely
verbatim, from official Qiskit and IBM Quantum teaching material. That
material is copyright IBM Corp. and the Qiskit contributors, and is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original sources are listed below,
with a direct link to the upstream file for each.

Where the code has been modified, the modifications generally consist of
converting notebook cells into standalone scripts, commenting out plotting
calls, and minor renaming. The upstream material has since moved on to newer
Qiskit primitive APIs; the copies here reflect the API as of roughly 2023, and
in several cases the upstream lesson has been rewritten since.

